"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, April to May came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. In 2025 the middle saw March to April at 251% of normal and September to October at just 49%. Grid 15425 had its driest year in 1956, at 47% of normal.</p>"}
